display_name = "The Mossbound Herald"
description = "A colossal tortoise-fortress carrying an entire rooftop-garden ruin on its shell: trees, an archway, a tiny dormant bell tower. Calm teal circuitry, no corruption -- an ambulatory ruin that grazes the plains and only retaliates when struck. Leave it in peace and it will outwalk centuries."
